\item[S2] Curt McMullen, Rational maps and Teichmüller space, in Ben Bielefeld and Mikhail Lyubich (editors), Problems in holomorphic dynamics (1992). Density of cusps; Example III and second Conjecture, p. 10. \url{https://arxiv.org/pdf/math/9205209}.
